    <briefdescription>
<para>Two-Phase Set (2P-Set). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses two G-Sets: the &quot;add&quot; set A and the &quot;remove&quot; set R (tombstones). An element is a member if it is in A and NOT in R. Elements in R can never be re-added.</para>
